# Fakie Bigspin: rolling backward after an FS 180, popped off the tail (fakie), a 360 Shove-It (J + down,
# J again) with a backside 180 (regular: turning right) in the same air.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold left 92..130
hold ollie 250..272
tap flip+down 276
tap flip 279
hold right 281..320
run 520
expect event pop{fakie=true} within 273..273
expect event comboLanded{name=Fakie Bigspin} within 330..470
expect no event bail
